# Conformance probe pack for the order of model_keys when a `when … as` key
# (spec 0.30) stands before another outer key and an `inner` line (spec 0.34,
# Capability), most significant bit first. Public. One kind (ruling 8 of 0.5),
# served by the common `when`.
#
#   byte 0      a common when, 5 or 6, bound to n
#   byte 1      w
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-fixed message
format     conformance-inner-askeep
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
when    8  5,6  as probe.n
field   probe.w  8  uint
kind    only
inner   conformance-inner-fixed
